6. LICENSE VERIFICATION

The Software contacts https://license.una.email when it starts and about once
a day to confirm its evaluation period or License Key. Each check sends the
Install's id, its mail domain, its License Key if one is installed, and, as
part of any network request, the server's IP address. No mail, message
content, user names or addresses of your users are sent. The Licensor uses
this information only to operate licensing, prevent misuse of the evaluation
period and enforce this agreement. The Software needs outbound HTTPS access to
license.una.email to operate; if it cannot confirm its license for fourteen
(14) days, it restricts itself as it does when a license expires. Blocking,
spoofing or interfering with this check is a breach of section 3(g).

